        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin Traditional Mortise Privacy Bolt with Colonial Emergency Release Trim, BAL 0419/0406</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBaldwin's 0419 Privacy Bolt features the classic beauty that is iconic of traditional decor--simple yet timelessly elegant. Mortise privacy bolts are most often used on bedrooms and bathrooms. This bolt is not meant for security purposes as, in case of emergencies, the bolt can be retracted from the exterior side of the door through the Colonial Emergency release rose. For doors 1-3/8\" to 2-1/4\" thick with 2-3/8\" backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for Baldwin's 0419 Traditional Privacy Door Bolt with Colonial Emergency Release Trim\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Faceplate Height: 2/14\"</li>\r\n<li>Faceplate Width: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Rose Height: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Rose Width: 1-3/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection: 1-1/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Trim Width:  11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Trim Height:  2-5/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" - 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Includes: faceplate, strike, dustbox, bolt, interior rose with turnpiece, emergency release exterior trim and emergency release key. \r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
